1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,199
AI is everywhere at work.

2
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:05,425
But good questions and ideas can get lost.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,801
Welcome to Spine.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,224
Ask the question only your company can answer.

5
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,141
A Champion helps you move forward.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,231
Once shared, that answer helps the next person
too.

7
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,353
Give a useful idea a place to start and a
decision that moves it forward.

8
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,491
Find the people who want to build it with you.

9
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,049
